## Key Insights
- The dashboard covers 100 employees with a total salary of 12.1M and an average salary of 121.1K.
- Marketing has the highest total salary by department (2.60M), followed by HR (2.47M) and IT (2.13M), while Operations has the lowest (1.48M).
- Among Indian cities, Mumbai has the highest total salary, followed by Chennai (2.21M) and Pune (2.15M), while Delhi has the lowest (1.57M).
- Salary is spread unevenly across departments and cities, so the Gender, Status and Country slicers help compare groups.

## Tools Used
Power BI Desktop, Excel
